<% if @reason == "BudgetExhausted" %>
Your organization, <%= @org.display_login %>, has reached its budget limit for <%= @sku_string %>.

As a result, <%= @sku_string %> cannot be enabled on new private repositories. Existing features on current repositories will not be affected.
<% if @billing_access %>

To restore access, adjust your budget in your billing settings.
<% else %>

To restore access, contact an organization owner or billing manager to adjust your budget.
<% end %>
<% else %>
We have detected a billing issue affecting <%= @sku_string %>
on your organization account, <%= @org.display_login %>.

Until you take action to address the billing issue, you cannot enable <%= @sku_string %> features on any new private repositories. Existing features on current repositories will not be affected.

Please review and update your billing settings or contact GitHub Support if you need assistance.
<% end %>

<% if @billing_access %>
Billing Settings: <%= GitHub.url %>/organizations/<%= @org.display_login %>/settings/billing/summary
<% end %>
Contact Support: https://support.github.com/request/landing

<%= @footer %>

Thanks,
GitHub.com
